  "closing.potential": "We see that the potential of Store {{store_name}} has not yet been maximized. Please click the following link to schedule a deeper consultation session to find the right solution for your business.\n\ncal-bd2.ahacommerce.net\n\nWe hope what we have shared can be beneficial.",
  "closing.valueAdd": "We are confident that the AHA system can add value to Store {{store_name}} directly, however we need to consider the profit potential for both parties in this collaboration.\n\nThrough our experience with hundreds of online stores, we are concerned that the brand may not be able to reach the desired profit level when AHA service fees are added.\nTherefore, with a heavy heart, we are unable to collaborate with {{store_name}} at this stage.\n\nHowever, we have an alternative collaboration scheme where AHA can become a brand partner and provide funding in exchange for brand equity. This program is called AHA Coventures. For more information, please see the registration form at: bit.ly/AHACoventures",
  "closing.directAnalysis": "We have conducted a direct analysis of Store {{store_name}}. Based on our experience, stores that are successfully managed by AHA Commerce are generally those that have achieved Mall status, as this status indicates a level of trust and more stable growth potential.\n\nHowever, since Store {{store_name}} does not yet have Mall status, we cannot guarantee that the AHA system can deliver a significant increase in revenue.\n\nNevertheless, we can assist with the Mall application process if the BRAND plans to advance to that stage. There are several requirements (terms) that need to be met, including:\nThe brand already has a HAKI trademark certificate for the product class\nHAKI class 35 certificate (sales services), and\nEmbossed brand logo on products\n\nIf the brand is willing and has completed the above requirements, we would be happy to discuss further and assist with the Mall status application process by scheduling a follow-up meeting at the following calendly link: https://calendly.com/meeting-with-ahacommerce/2ndmeeting\n\nWe hope this evaluation can serve as useful input for the {{store_name}} team in future store development.",
  "closing.noBrand": "We have conducted a direct analysis of Store {{store_name}}, however based on our experience, stores that are successfully managed by AHA are stores that have their own brand and the brand has started to be recognized in the market.\n\nSince Store {{store_name}} is not a store with its own brand, we are not confident that the AHA system can deliver a significant increase in revenue.\n\nTherefore, with a heavy heart, we are unable to collaborate with {{store_name}} at this stage.\n\nRegardless, we hope our evaluation is beneficial for the {{store_name}} team to identify areas that need improvement.\n\nHowever, this does not close the door for future collaboration between {{store_name}} and AHA Commerce.",
  "closing.experience": "Through our experience with hundreds of online stores, an online store's revenue is highly dependent on the store's operational performance level (on-time delivery >90%, cancellation rate <1%, etc.).\n\nWe are confident that the AHA system can add value to Store {{store_name}} by increasing incoming orders and significantly boosting revenue from current levels. However, we observe a fairly high delay rate, and our concern is that if orders increase and the delay rate rises, it could potentially cause the store to receive penalties and affect store performance.\n\nTherefore, if the brand can maximize delivery speed and bring the delay rate below 2% and packaging time under one day, we are very open to further discussions for collaboration with {{store_name}}.",

